# Games - all-users Start-menu default fragment. Migrated verbatim from the
# old hardcoded startmenu_init(), PLUS the two entries that used to live in
# /GAMES.CFG (Commander Keen 4/6) - that file existed only on the golden
# image, dated 4 July, and was never in git; this is that content, now
# reproducible by a build. One unified submenu: native games (sys_spawn), the
# Win16 Entertainment Pack titles + SkiFree (win16_run, type=win16), and the
# DOS games (dos_run, type=dos). See #208.
category: Games
item: Maytera Arena | /APPS/ARENA | icon=game_arena
item: Maytera Chess | /APPS/CHESS | icon=game_chess
item: Maytera Squadron | /APPS/SQUADRON | icon=game_squadron
item: AssaultCube | /APPS/ASSAULTCUBE | icon=game
item: ClassiCube | /APPS/CLASSICUBE | icon=game
# #537: DOOM lives at /GAMES/DOOM/DOOM.ELF (alongside its DOOM1.WAD); the old
# /APPS/DOOM.ELF path did not exist, so that hardcoded entry launched nothing
# for an unknown length of time. The existence check in
# startmenu_model.rs::sm_model_finish() means a mistake like that now just
# fails to render the item, instead of rendering an item that launches
# nothing.
item: DOOM | /GAMES/DOOM/DOOM.ELF | icon=game_doom
item: Lemmings | /APPS/lemmings | icon=game_lemmings
item: Solitaire | /APPS/SOLITAIRE | icon=game_solitaire
